WEBVTT

01:36.570 --> 01:40.030
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.140 --> 01:41.870
[Episode 30]

01:42.840 --> 01:44.490
[Notice Board of Fenghua Express]

01:53.930 --> 01:54.759
Fenghua.

01:57.350 --> 01:58.120
Fenghua!

02:22.400 --> 02:23.020
Hello?

02:23.040 --> 02:24.200
Where are you?

02:24.520 --> 02:25.400
I brought you food.

02:25.420 --> 02:26.420
I'm at your doorstep.

02:27.060 --> 02:28.329
I'm going home for the New Year.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.930
I'm on my way to the train station.

02:30.160 --> 02:30.930
What?

02:32.490 --> 02:34.210
Aren't you going back with us?

02:34.240 --> 02:36.130
I was planning to drive back.

02:36.310 --> 02:37.870
Driving is too tiring.

02:37.910 --> 02:39.190
The high-speed train is more convenient.

02:40.950 --> 02:42.880
This is so sudden.

02:43.370 --> 02:45.370
Going home without saying a word?

02:47.050 --> 02:48.360
I miss my mom.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.870
My mom misses me too.

02:50.110 --> 02:52.130
I don't have much going on here anyway.

02:52.360 --> 02:53.630
When are you going back?

02:53.710 --> 02:54.920
By car or train?

02:58.380 --> 02:59.170
Hello?

03:02.830 --> 03:03.580
Fenghua.

03:05.520 --> 03:07.330
What's going on with you lately?

03:07.360 --> 03:09.430
Didn't we agree to go back together?

03:11.020 --> 03:13.250
The signal is bad. I'll hang up.

03:35.510 --> 03:37.810
Mei, preparing for the New Year?

03:38.010 --> 03:39.400
When do your holidays start?

03:38.060 --> 03:42.340
[By the Canal]

03:39.670 --> 03:40.240
Mom.

03:40.280 --> 03:41.680
Have you prepared the New Year goods?

03:42.110 --> 03:42.790
Mom!

03:45.960 --> 03:47.150
Fenghua?

03:47.190 --> 03:49.329
Fenghua! Why are you back?

03:50.790 --> 03:52.530
Why didn't you tell me you were coming back?

03:52.590 --> 03:54.800
I could've picked you up at the station.

03:54.820 --> 03:56.200
Didn't I tell you?

03:56.280 --> 03:57.280
I don't have much to do there,

03:57.280 --> 03:58.360
so I came back early

03:58.380 --> 03:59.579
to spend a few more days with you.

03:59.610 --> 04:00.710
Why have you lost weight?

04:00.990 --> 04:02.420
Come on, let's go home.

04:03.750 --> 04:05.010
What about Wanghe and the others?

04:05.480 --> 04:06.920
They'll be here in a few days, I guess.

04:06.940 --> 04:08.480
The food delivery industry is busy now.

04:08.590 --> 04:09.590
We're in parcel delivery.

04:09.590 --> 04:11.680
Near the end of the year, there's not much business.

04:12.620 --> 04:13.770
Right on time.

04:13.840 --> 04:16.050
Look at the smoked fish Mr. Zhou gave us.

04:16.079 --> 04:17.040
I'll cook it for you tonight.

04:17.070 --> 04:17.930
You're in for a treat.

04:19.829 --> 04:20.730
Fenghua.

04:21.829 --> 04:23.610
Fenghua, are you up?

04:24.070 --> 04:25.390
Do you know what time it is?

04:27.100 --> 04:28.950
Fenghua, get up now.

04:28.970 --> 04:31.310
How can you stay inside in the day?

04:31.680 --> 04:32.270
Get up, get up.

04:32.270 --> 04:33.200
Get some sunshine.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.800
It's so sunny outside today.

04:34.830 --> 04:35.770
Come on, my baby.

04:36.430 --> 04:37.360
I'm tired.

04:37.830 --> 04:38.600
Tired?

04:38.680 --> 04:39.680
Too tired to get some sun?

04:39.680 --> 04:40.430
Look at this princess.

04:41.520 --> 04:43.490
Look at your messy hair.

04:44.760 --> 04:46.409
It's like a chicken's nest.

04:47.990 --> 04:48.680
Wait...

04:48.710 --> 04:50.540
Why are you losing so much hair?

04:52.580 --> 04:54.860
I have too many things to worry about.

04:54.890 --> 04:56.820
It's already better than before.

04:56.950 --> 04:58.700
There was a time when I was almost bald.

04:58.830 --> 04:59.710
Look at my hairline.

05:03.340 --> 05:04.180
Look at you.

05:04.270 --> 05:05.270
You're exhausted.

05:05.730 --> 05:07.140
Tired from work.

05:07.430 --> 05:08.610
Quit your job and come home.

05:08.680 --> 05:09.990
Don't stay in Beijing anymore.

05:10.730 --> 05:11.580
I'll take care of you.

05:13.330 --> 05:15.250
Your dad and I don't rely on your earnings.

05:15.280 --> 05:16.430
Just stay at home.

05:16.450 --> 05:18.120
There will always be hot soup and meals for you.

05:18.150 --> 05:20.270
I promise to raise you nice and plump.

05:22.270 --> 05:23.720
Say something. What do you think?

05:27.680 --> 05:28.960
What's wrong?

05:31.630 --> 05:32.360
Nothing.

05:33.650 --> 05:35.570
I just suddenly feel like singing.

05:38.260 --> 05:40.180
When Siyi was here,

05:41.030 --> 05:42.100
I didn't dare sing.

05:43.320 --> 05:44.400
I didn't want to upset her.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.780
Now I can sing freely.

05:50.270 --> 05:55.870
♫In this world, there's no one else like Mom♫

05:56.340 --> 06:02.270
♫A child with a mom is like treasure♫

06:02.830 --> 06:03.640
Gosh.

06:03.660 --> 06:05.940
Still as crazy as when you were little.

06:06.420 --> 06:08.780
Let's see which boy can handle you in the future.

06:11.070 --> 06:16.720
♫Throw yourself into Mom's embrace♫

06:17.000 --> 06:22.040
♫Endless happiness♫

06:23.190 --> 06:29.310
♫In this world, there's no one else like Mom♫

06:29.510 --> 06:34.710
♫A child with a mom is like treasure♫

06:35.680 --> 06:41.070
♫Throw yourself into Mom's embrace♫

06:41.070 --> 06:45.120
♫Endless happiness♫

06:55.770 --> 06:57.720
How's your tofu pudding shop doing?

06:57.750 --> 07:00.890
It's been great. I'm earning more than when I had a street stall.

07:00.910 --> 07:02.600
And I'm sheltered from the wind and sun.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.550
It's comfortable.

07:04.060 --> 07:06.760
If you move back and want something to do,

07:06.790 --> 07:08.200
I'll give you this shop.

07:08.220 --> 07:09.620
I'll go rent another shop.

07:09.650 --> 07:11.060
Oh, please don't.

07:11.080 --> 07:12.630
I don't want to run a shop.

07:13.040 --> 07:13.560
Then...

07:13.580 --> 07:15.050
what do you want to do?

07:15.110 --> 07:16.200
None of your business.

07:16.220 --> 07:17.530
I've been in Beijing for so many years.

07:17.630 --> 07:18.630
It wasn't for nothing.

07:18.940 --> 07:19.630
Besides,

07:19.680 --> 07:21.630
I haven't decided if I'm moving back.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.420
Then you...

07:25.750 --> 07:27.030
Xingchi, you're back.

07:27.050 --> 07:27.950
Auntie.

07:28.640 --> 07:29.990
When did you come back?

07:30.160 --> 07:30.950
Yesterday.

07:33.530 --> 07:35.370
If I'd known, I'd have come with you.

07:35.880 --> 07:38.200
You came back yourself? Where are the other two?

07:38.690 --> 07:39.750
They're grown-ups who

07:39.800 --> 07:41.130
can buy their own tickets.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.350
What's wrong?

07:42.450 --> 07:43.460
Did they fight?

07:45.630 --> 07:46.360
I don't know.

07:47.040 --> 07:47.750
Don't worry.

07:49.390 --> 07:51.320
There's still time till the holidays.

07:51.620 --> 07:53.140
Why did you suddenly come back?

07:54.270 --> 07:55.440
Aren't you busy with work?

07:58.270 --> 07:59.670
I was a bit tired before.

07:59.690 --> 08:01.360
So I asked Wanghe for leave.

08:02.420 --> 08:03.420
I came back early

08:03.670 --> 08:04.550
to spend time with you.

08:04.760 --> 08:06.230
Were you fired?

08:06.270 --> 08:07.250
No!

08:07.800 --> 08:08.390
Really?

08:08.630 --> 08:09.430
Really.

08:09.850 --> 08:11.860
I finished everything before I came back.

08:17.630 --> 08:19.320
You don't have a proper degree.

08:19.340 --> 08:21.820
We don't have experience working in big companies.

08:22.690 --> 08:23.900
You got into Bee

08:23.930 --> 08:25.650
thanks to Wanghe's help.

08:26.540 --> 08:27.270
So,

08:28.200 --> 08:29.460
however tough or tiring it is,

08:30.040 --> 08:31.120
you have to work hard.

08:32.049 --> 08:33.650
Don't hold Wanghe back.

08:37.280 --> 08:37.730
Alright,

08:37.799 --> 08:39.280
I'll go make you some good food.

08:57.140 --> 09:01.040
[Old Street Tofu Pudding Shop]

09:01.190 --> 09:08.890
[Signature honey tofu pudding]

09:06.430 --> 09:07.320
Are you free?

09:07.950 --> 09:08.840
I'll treat you to tea.

09:08.960 --> 09:13.890
[Business Hours]

09:11.150 --> 09:13.200
Who drinks tea this late at night?

09:13.240 --> 09:13.870
Let's drink alcohol.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.230
But you can barely drink...

09:16.230 --> 09:18.090
I'll keep you company while you drink.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.030
Deal?

09:19.880 --> 09:20.520
Deal.

09:20.950 --> 09:21.590
Let's go.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.560
I remember this place

09:33.960 --> 09:35.530
used to be an internet café, right?

09:35.720 --> 09:36.350
Yeah.

09:36.390 --> 09:37.960
We used to come here often.

09:39.440 --> 09:41.030
The three of us pretended to be Chris Lee

09:41.080 --> 09:42.320
and chatted with you online.

09:42.670 --> 09:44.030
You even ended up in tears.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.390
How dare you bring that up?

09:46.600 --> 09:48.280
It really upset me.

09:48.760 --> 09:50.210
I'd have killed you guys if Wanghe didn't make it up to me.

09:55.260 --> 09:56.560
How did he make it up?

09:58.390 --> 10:00.390
He took me to Chris Lee's concert.

10:05.770 --> 10:06.920
I bought tickets too.

10:09.840 --> 10:11.350
When I arrived that day,

10:12.790 --> 10:14.080
they said you two had just left.

10:18.880 --> 10:21.140
If Chris Lee has another concert,

10:21.470 --> 10:22.470
let's go together.

10:26.000 --> 10:26.710
Sure.

10:27.170 --> 10:27.880
Just the two of us.

10:28.860 --> 10:29.620
No one else.

10:33.270 --> 10:33.980
Fenghua.

10:35.350 --> 10:37.230
If you ever get sick of Beijing, are exhausted,

10:38.270 --> 10:39.630
and want to move back home,

10:41.180 --> 10:42.180
I'll join you.

10:44.310 --> 10:45.890
No matter where you go or what you do

10:46.450 --> 10:47.490
in the future,

10:48.570 --> 10:49.790
I'll be with you.

10:57.270 --> 10:58.740
I haven't decided

10:58.910 --> 11:00.030
if I'm moving back.

11:00.790 --> 11:02.270
And I don't need your company.

11:03.440 --> 11:05.450
I love being alone now.

11:05.470 --> 11:06.230
Really.

11:10.100 --> 11:11.240
So...

11:12.810 --> 11:14.640
do you plan to stay single forever?

11:17.360 --> 11:18.600
In the future...

11:20.550 --> 11:22.240
I'll find someone

11:22.260 --> 11:23.810
who really spoils me.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.720
I'll go wherever I want.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.480
New York,

11:28.850 --> 11:29.560
Paris,

11:29.970 --> 11:30.930
Maldives.

11:31.730 --> 11:33.200
I'll do whatever I want

11:33.230 --> 11:34.630
and eat whatever I want.

11:35.630 --> 11:37.270
He'll send me flowers every day.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.420
I can use his credit card as I please.

11:39.670 --> 11:40.910
And our garage

11:40.960 --> 11:42.870
will be overloaded with cars.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.200
I hadn't seen much of the world as a kid.

11:47.910 --> 11:49.270
Even getting free ice cream

11:49.300 --> 11:50.640
made me happy.

11:52.200 --> 11:53.390
Now that I'm grown up,

11:54.670 --> 11:56.360
I think it's better to be more practical.

11:58.880 --> 12:00.270
Am I right?

12:04.360 --> 12:05.120
You're right.

12:08.760 --> 12:09.390
Come on,

12:09.960 --> 12:10.750
let's toast to

12:11.520 --> 12:12.670
our future happiness.

12:16.500 --> 12:17.270
Absolutely.

12:49.860 --> 12:50.500
Still here?

12:51.670 --> 12:52.420
Almost done.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.510
There's still a market analysis that

12:54.510 --> 12:55.670
Finance needs to review.

12:56.870 --> 12:58.480
It's a day before New Year’s Eve.

12:58.550 --> 12:59.960
Not going back to your hometown?

13:00.550 --> 13:02.750
I'll finish it and then drive back

13:02.750 --> 13:03.650
right away.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.850
Don't push yourself.

13:06.510 --> 13:07.670
I'll stay with my mom for the Eve.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.870
Let's drive back together on the 2nd or 3rd of the New Year.

13:10.670 --> 13:12.400
Just spend time with your mom.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.270
I need to go back.

13:13.750 --> 13:14.790
I need to talk to Fenghua.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.550
Can't you talk over the phone?

13:17.510 --> 13:18.080
No,

13:18.790 --> 13:19.870
I must talk to her in person.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.030
Alright then.

13:22.100 --> 13:23.580
Be careful on the road later.

13:23.630 --> 13:24.360
I'll be off then.

13:24.980 --> 13:26.000
Say hello to your mom for me.

13:26.030 --> 13:26.940
Go home soon.

13:27.010 --> 13:27.700
Drive safely.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.180
Aunt Yan.

14:34.140 --> 14:35.780
Wanghe, you're back for the New Year.

14:36.530 --> 14:37.390
How did you come back?

14:37.440 --> 14:38.720
By car or plane?

14:38.740 --> 14:39.580
I drove.

14:40.250 --> 14:41.010
Where's Fenghua?

14:42.880 --> 14:44.260
Looking for her as soon as you're back?

14:44.600 --> 14:45.700
That girl

14:45.720 --> 14:47.440
came back without saying a word

14:47.470 --> 14:48.460
and didn't wait for me.

14:48.500 --> 14:49.500
So disloyal.

14:49.530 --> 14:51.040
I know. That child...

14:51.070 --> 14:53.390
It'd have been nice to come back together!

14:53.390 --> 14:55.150
I'll call her. She's sleeping.

14:58.880 --> 14:59.610
Fenghua.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.590
Fenghua.

15:00.910 --> 15:01.600
Fenghua?

15:01.630 --> 15:03.000
Wanghe is back.

15:05.320 --> 15:06.800
Still sleeping in.

15:06.960 --> 15:07.750
When she wakes up,

15:07.770 --> 15:09.290
I'll tell her to find you.

15:09.640 --> 15:11.250
Still sleeping at this hour?

15:11.520 --> 15:14.060
She went out drinking with Xingchi yesterday.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.370
She came back at midnight.

15:16.280 --> 15:17.200
Go rest at home.

15:17.240 --> 15:18.810
You must be tired from driving.

15:18.830 --> 15:20.070
Come here to eat when you're hungry.

15:21.160 --> 15:23.200
I'll tell her to find you when she wakes up.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.160
Alright.

15:35.470 --> 15:36.440
I applied

15:37.170 --> 15:38.370
for your leave with Meng.

15:39.170 --> 15:40.710
Your year-end bonus was cut by 70%.

15:45.580 --> 15:46.490
It doesn't matter.

15:48.210 --> 15:49.790
I expected nothing anyway.

16:07.410 --> 16:08.460
Save some for me.

16:10.200 --> 16:10.910
You don't deserve it.

16:14.030 --> 16:15.010
Because of you,

16:15.990 --> 16:17.670
the delivery riders at Station 203

16:18.210 --> 16:19.660
aren't getting year-end bonuses.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.810
If you keep sneezing these days,

16:23.230 --> 16:24.630
it's because they're cursing you behind your back.

16:25.520 --> 16:26.430
Let them.

16:28.500 --> 16:30.470
A few curses won't hurt.

16:33.960 --> 16:34.960
How's Fenghua?

16:38.970 --> 16:40.620
Didn't you two drink last night?

16:44.850 --> 16:45.750
What's wrong?

16:46.590 --> 16:47.600
I can't even

16:47.630 --> 16:49.270
drink alone with her anymore?

16:51.290 --> 16:53.070
She hasn't been feeling well.

17:03.440 --> 17:04.589
What did you two talk about?

17:06.960 --> 17:08.160
Can you tell me

17:09.400 --> 17:10.550
what you two talked about?

17:16.250 --> 17:17.530
Wash the dishes after you're done.

18:09.580 --> 18:10.580
Fenghua.

18:16.120 --> 18:16.920
Just got up?

18:19.110 --> 18:19.830
Morning.

18:21.470 --> 18:22.260
Did you...

18:22.290 --> 18:23.480
drive back?

18:24.990 --> 18:25.910
I drove all night.

18:25.940 --> 18:27.020
Just got here this morning.

18:28.740 --> 18:29.490
Are you tired?

18:30.260 --> 18:31.140
I'm fine.

18:32.680 --> 18:34.300
If you want to make it through the night,

18:34.820 --> 18:35.900
you should take a nap.

18:37.120 --> 18:38.350
Let's go somewhere tonight

18:38.350 --> 18:39.450
to set off fireworks.

18:41.390 --> 18:42.450
We'll see.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.070
It's so cold. I don't feel like going out.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.370
Get some sleep first.

18:47.390 --> 18:49.130
I'm going to help out at my mom's shop.

18:50.610 --> 18:51.330
Fenghua.

19:00.890 --> 19:01.810
Are you...

19:04.630 --> 19:05.950
feeling better?

19:07.930 --> 19:08.830
Don't worry.

19:08.990 --> 19:09.800
I'm already better.

19:30.550 --> 19:32.070
This fatty is quite funny.

19:33.000 --> 19:35.180
Come, come.

19:35.690 --> 19:36.200
Fenghua.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.350
Stop watching TV.

19:37.350 --> 19:37.960
Hurry.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.350
Let's have New Year's Eve dinner.

19:39.350 --> 19:40.350
Careful, don't burn yourself.

19:41.130 --> 19:41.640
Hurry.

19:41.640 --> 19:43.120
Pour the wine.

19:43.920 --> 19:44.730
Fenghua.

19:44.910 --> 19:47.110
Aren't you hot wearing so much?

19:47.310 --> 19:49.160
Don't you remember? You and your dad

19:49.160 --> 19:50.590
saved up to buy this for me.

19:50.590 --> 19:52.160
It's so precious, so I never wear it.

19:52.160 --> 19:54.160
But I've to wear it for the New Year.

19:54.190 --> 19:55.500
It's so festive for the New Year.

19:55.550 --> 19:56.510
Red and prosperous.

19:56.510 --> 19:57.200
Exactly.

19:57.220 --> 19:57.940
Try the egg dumplings.

19:57.960 --> 19:58.480
Let's...

19:58.790 --> 20:00.510
have a toast first. Cheers!

20:00.640 --> 20:01.720
Come on, come on.

20:01.720 --> 20:02.240
Cheers!

20:02.240 --> 20:05.430
Happy New Year!

20:06.680 --> 20:08.030
Try this. This too.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.180
Happy New Year!

20:09.310 --> 20:09.890
Wanghe!

20:09.920 --> 20:11.240
Wanghe, you're here!

20:11.270 --> 20:12.290
Quick, quick!

20:12.750 --> 20:14.030
We made too many pork knuckles.

20:14.030 --> 20:14.920
My mom asked me to bring

20:14.920 --> 20:15.680
a plate over.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.920
That's so kind of you.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.720
Thank you.

20:17.720 --> 20:19.160
Please, sit down. Sit here.

20:19.160 --> 20:21.000
Come on, have a drink with your uncle.

20:21.000 --> 20:21.790
Let's have a drink.

20:21.790 --> 20:22.640
Grab a glass.

20:22.640 --> 20:23.070
Pour the wine.

20:23.070 --> 20:23.550
Well, um...

20:23.550 --> 20:24.590
I... I won't drink.

20:24.590 --> 20:26.160
My parents are waiting for me at home.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.530
I'll come later to pay my New Year's respects.

20:27.560 --> 20:28.440
Wait! Wait!

20:28.440 --> 20:29.200
Wait! Wait!

20:29.590 --> 20:30.310
Listen.

20:30.760 --> 20:31.640
Well...

20:31.640 --> 20:33.160
I don't have any good wine.

20:33.160 --> 20:34.920
Take this wine back for your dad to drink.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.180
Take it, take it.

20:36.350 --> 20:37.290
Fenghua.

20:38.350 --> 20:39.830
Then I'll head back first.

20:39.830 --> 20:40.640
Alright.

20:40.640 --> 20:41.270
Okay.

20:41.270 --> 20:43.240
Tell your dad later that

20:43.240 --> 20:44.240
I'll go drink with him.

20:44.240 --> 20:44.960
Yes, yes.

20:45.570 --> 20:46.640
Tell your mom to

20:46.640 --> 20:47.740
come over for a meal.

20:47.770 --> 20:48.440
Okay?

20:49.520 --> 20:50.300
Fenghua.

20:52.070 --> 20:53.550
What's going on?

20:53.960 --> 20:55.270
Did you two have a fight?

20:56.050 --> 20:56.840
No.

20:58.270 --> 20:59.250
