21:40.130 --> 21:41.130
Nothing's wrong.

21:42.330 --> 21:44.370
Then why have you been avoiding me?

21:45.680 --> 21:47.700
I haven't been avoiding you.

21:47.730 --> 21:49.340
You're being sensitive.

21:50.570 --> 21:51.320
Fenghua.

21:52.780 --> 21:54.520
We've known each other for ages.

21:56.100 --> 21:57.310
If there's anything,

21:57.440 --> 21:58.440
