22:22.230 --> 22:23.870
But since you've asked...

22:26.790 --> 22:28.640
I really liked you before.

22:30.070 --> 22:31.830
I've liked you since we were kids.

22:32.990 --> 22:34.160
In my life,

22:34.160 --> 22:35.400
I've only liked two people.

22:36.360 --> 22:37.730
One is Chris Lee,

22:38.770 --> 22:39.570
and the other is you.

22:42.690 --> 22:44.230
But after we kissed that day,

22:45.650 --> 22:47.370
I felt like everything fell apart instantly.

22:49.160 --> 22:49.920
Fell apart?

22:51.170 --> 22:52.050
Why?

22:55.680 --> 22:57.070
I felt really deflated.

22:57.570 --> 22:58.470
It felt meaningless.

23:00.560 --> 23:02.140
I realized afterwards

23:03.660 --> 23:05.290
that my liking you

23:06.160 --> 23:08.540
was just a habit since childhood.

23:11.640 --> 23:13.060
It wasn't my true feelings.

23:15.350 --> 23:16.350
Over these years,

23:17.900 --> 23:19.290
