27:44.840 --> 27:46.670
immediate hospitalization

27:46.720 --> 27:47.720
for surgical treatment.

27:50.500 --> 27:53.850
[Fenghua Express]

28:20.960 --> 28:22.000
Fenghua!

28:21.100 --> 28:23.940
[Fenghua Express]

28:22.940 --> 28:24.560
You look much more rosy.

28:24.060 --> 28:27.170
[We're the experts in shipping parcels]

28:25.550 --> 28:27.420
You really scared me that day.

28:27.440 --> 28:28.760
I didn't rest well then.

28:31.490 --> 28:32.100
Auntie.

28:33.170 --> 28:35.610
How about we merge with Mr. Sun?

28:35.740 --> 28:36.690
Merge?

28:37.330 --> 28:38.290
What do you mean?

28:39.020 --> 28:40.330
We're all in the same company.

28:40.360 --> 28:41.940
The process would be swift.

28:42.030 --> 28:44.040
After merging, it'll be a larger scale

28:44.200 --> 28:45.260
and more efficient.

28:45.580 --> 28:46.800
Absolutely not.

28:47.180 --> 28:48.670
They're too sloppy

28:48.690 --> 28:50.030
and don't care about after-sales service.

28:50.110 --> 28:51.060
Besides,

28:51.720 --> 28:53.050
that Mr. Sun

28:53.080 --> 28:54.440
is so harsh on employees.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.810
Alright.

28:59.670 --> 29:01.210
I'll talk to him first.

29:21.180 --> 29:22.780
We can discuss

29:22.960 --> 29:23.960
cooperating.

29:24.860 --> 29:26.390
But your conditions

29:27.190 --> 29:28.820
seem a bit like bullying.

29:29.540 --> 29:31.370
We can negotiate the details.

29:32.850 --> 29:34.600
With your low business volume,

29:34.640 --> 29:36.320
you still want to talk details with me?

29:36.340 --> 29:37.930
Our business volume is average,

29:38.570 --> 29:40.320
but our user retention is high.

29:40.350 --> 29:41.540
They're all repeat customers.

29:41.560 --> 29:43.320
We've consistently got the most positive reviews

29:43.350 --> 29:45.320
according to HQ's backend data.

29:45.880 --> 29:47.640
But the costs are high too.

29:48.340 --> 29:50.040
If everyone worked like you do,

29:50.240 --> 29:51.550
how'd the company make money?

29:56.560 --> 29:58.370
During our cooperation,

29:58.750 --> 30:01.050
who helped you find lost packages?

30:01.270 --> 30:02.380
With your warehouse overflow,

30:02.410 --> 30:04.030
who cleared space for you?

30:04.210 --> 30:06.650
When your customers and employees got into fights,

30:06.680 --> 30:08.740
who helped deal with the aftermath?

30:08.960 --> 30:10.470
Your business is profitable,

30:11.110 --> 30:12.380
but it also has many hidden risks.

30:12.670 --> 30:13.930
If you continue like this,

30:14.160 --> 30:15.640
what credibility will you have left?

30:20.510 --> 30:21.510
Mr. Sun.

30:21.880 --> 30:23.360
Our advantage

30:23.830 --> 30:25.490
is focusing on after-sales service.

30:25.590 --> 30:27.310
Your advantage is high volume.

30:27.510 --> 30:28.960
If we work together,

30:28.960 --> 30:30.280
we might still win.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.640
Fighting alone,

30:31.890 --> 30:33.420
we'll both end up dead in the end.

30:52.910 --> 30:53.930
Mr. Meng?

30:54.600 --> 30:55.750
What brings you here?

30:56.720 --> 30:57.960
I was passing by

30:58.160 --> 31:00.160
and saw just one place in the building with the lights on.

31:02.510 --> 31:04.310
I've been busy.

31:04.510 --> 31:06.070
I lost track of time.

31:09.460 --> 31:12.100
The test results for the new navigation system are excellent.

31:15.200 --> 31:15.720
Have a seat.

31:16.490 --> 31:16.970
Okay.

31:19.730 --> 31:21.110
You did great this time.

31:22.200 --> 31:24.430
Time was still a bit tight this time.

31:24.570 --> 31:26.500
It'd be better if I had six more months.

31:26.720 --> 31:27.920
If you'd joined the company earlier,

31:27.920 --> 31:30.040
they could've avoided many detours.

31:30.600 --> 31:31.520
You're too kind.

31:31.990 --> 31:32.750
Previously,

31:33.090 --> 31:34.910
Wanghe applied for stock options on your behalf.

31:34.930 --> 31:36.190
I didn't approve it.

31:39.530 --> 31:41.680
After all, you haven't been with the company for long,

31:41.680 --> 31:43.060
without much contribution.

31:43.800 --> 31:46.340
Excessive rewards are a major taboo in company management.

31:47.960 --> 31:48.640
Got it.

31:52.550 --> 31:53.620
I completely understand.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.350
Okay.

31:58.000 --> 31:58.750
Get back to work.

31:59.300 --> 32:00.120
Oh, by the way,

32:00.460 --> 32:02.350
