32:06.000 --> 32:06.950
It's not a lot of options,

32:07.510 --> 32:09.430
but it's a small token of our appreciation.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.200
Don't stay too late.

32:36.910 --> 32:39.050
Xiaohui, what are you doing?

32:42.790 --> 32:44.080
It's Monday.

32:43.070 --> 32:50.710
[Food Delivery Training] [Recruiting Delivery Riders]

32:44.160 --> 32:45.490
