36:40.520 --> 36:41.770
Just wait for my complaint.

36:41.800 --> 36:43.400
Hello? Sir.

36:43.500 --> 36:45.110
Sir, hello?

36:47.670 --> 36:49.440
I've already been late thrice this month

36:49.440 --> 36:51.150
and fined quite a bit.

36:51.150 --> 36:52.630
Now I've got another complaint.

36:52.630 --> 36:53.190
That's like

36:53.190 --> 36:55.090
another black mark in the system.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.640
I've asked around at the company.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.400
They said

36:58.400 --> 36:59.280
I'm basically

36:59.280 --> 37:00.480
on the blacklist now.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.840
When the platform assigns orders,

37:01.840 --> 37:03.070
they won't prioritize me.

37:03.070 --> 37:04.280
What am I supposed to do now?

37:04.280 --> 37:05.630
I'm finished, aren't I?

37:05.630 --> 37:07.230
Then why were you so careless?

37:15.250 --> 37:15.980
Come with me.

37:46.940 --> 37:50.880
[3 new messages from Class 082]

37:51.260 --> 37:55.770
[Fang Chentao: I had too much fun at the party yesterday.
I'm still a little dizzy. How's everyone?]

37:55.840 --> 38:02.420
[Xu Haoyan: Hahaha. Me too. I haven't had so much fun in a while!
I sent some photos I took in the group chat!]

38:17.480 --> 38:18.160
Sir,

38:18.180 --> 38:19.840
my supervisor and I are waiting for you downstairs.

38:19.840 --> 38:21.150
Could you come down to talk?

38:21.150 --> 38:22.480
I told you I'm busy.

38:22.480 --> 38:23.110
How will the platform handle it?

38:23.110 --> 38:24.590
Sir! Sir!

38:24.610 --> 38:25.820
I'm the delivery rider who contacted you.

38:25.850 --> 38:26.750
He's our supervisor.

38:26.840 --> 38:27.590
Hello, hello.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.350
What do you want?

38:28.930 --> 38:29.880
I'm sorry.

38:29.880 --> 38:32.280
I apologize on behalf of our delivery rider.

38:32.280 --> 38:33.440
We didn't deliver the meal to you in person.

38:33.440 --> 38:33.800
We're truly sorry.

38:33.800 --> 38:34.740
One hour.

38:34.880 --> 38:36.350
Didn't I wait for an hour?

38:36.720 --> 38:38.460
Look at the scorching sun now.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.670
You made me miss lunch!

38:39.670 --> 38:41.490
What's the point of saying sorry?

38:41.970 --> 38:42.440
We're so sorry...

38:42.440 --> 38:43.270
Let go!

38:43.480 --> 38:44.760
We're so, so sorry...

38:44.760 --> 38:46.120
How about this?

38:46.710 --> 38:48.150
I'll compensate you for this order.

38:48.150 --> 38:49.920
Could you please withdraw the complaint?

38:49.920 --> 38:51.230
Do you think I need the money?

38:51.230 --> 38:52.020
No, no.

38:52.280 --> 38:53.920
Why should I withdraw the complaint?

38:53.920 --> 38:55.480
Didn't you mess up?

38:55.480 --> 38:56.280
Why should I withdraw it?

38:56.280 --> 38:56.920
Yes, it's our fault.

38:56.920 --> 38:58.110
Let me teach you two a lesson.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.360
Complaining

38:59.360 --> 39:01.280
is a consumer's right.

39:01.280 --> 39:01.960
Understand?

39:01.960 --> 39:03.820
How is it my fault?

39:03.840 --> 39:04.440
Shut up.

39:04.440 --> 39:05.800
Do you know how long I'd been waiting for you?

39:05.800 --> 39:07.070
Who are you to yell at me?

39:07.070 --> 39:08.130
You're just a deliveryman!

39:09.840 --> 39:10.980
What you just said...

39:11.150 --> 39:11.840
isn't right.

39:14.310 --> 39:16.360
Are you here to apologize or pick a fight?

39:18.420 --> 39:20.060
Want me to withdraw the complaint?

39:20.840 --> 39:21.550
Fine.

39:22.150 --> 39:23.140
Get on your knees!

39:23.550 --> 39:24.880
Kowtow thrice!

39:26.840 --> 39:27.840
Can't do it?

39:27.930 --> 39:29.280
Kneel down!

39:35.360 --> 39:36.030
Turn left.

39:43.000 --> 39:44.030
Alright, you're done.

39:55.880 --> 39:56.550
Careful.

39:56.550 --> 39:57.190
Thank you.

39:59.070 --> 40:00.750
Rest early then.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.510
Okay.

40:03.090 --> 40:03.730
Good night.

40:05.330 --> 40:05.930
Good night.

40:06.620 --> 40:07.490
Bye.

40:31.230 --> 40:32.230
What does he do?

40:34.190 --> 40:34.920
He's in investing.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.070
Is it profitable?

40:39.960 --> 40:41.160
He's been making losses.

40:41.670 --> 40:42.840
But his family is wealthy.

40:43.710 --> 40:45.100
They own mines.

40:46.320 --> 40:47.480
What else do you want to know?

40:53.630 --> 40:55.260
Actually, you don't have to avoid me.

40:56.620 --> 40:57.880
I'm very prideful.

40:58.600 --> 41:00.580
If it doesn't work out, I'll pack up and leave.

41:01.460 --> 41:02.830
I won't pester you.

41:03.710 --> 41:04.860
You think

41:05.070 --> 41:06.760
I'm doing this for money?

41:08.400 --> 41:09.400
Isn't that the case?

41:11.890 --> 41:13.400
If that's what you want to believe,

41:13.710 --> 41:15.000
then I have nothing more to say.

41:17.150 --> 41:17.840
As for me,

41:17.860 --> 41:18.950
it's simple.

41:19.400 --> 41:20.590
I'm not ambitious.

41:21.790 --> 41:23.280
I just want to live a simple

41:23.280 --> 41:24.800
and comfortable life with you.

41:25.440 --> 41:26.960
That's why I wanted you to buy a house.

41:28.400 --> 41:30.230
But you refused without a second thought.

41:30.230 --> 41:31.360
I don't want to buy a house

41:32.280 --> 41:34.000
because I don't want to spend my family's money.

41:34.710 --> 41:36.190
I want to rely on my own efforts.

41:36.190 --> 41:37.810
But I can't wait any longer.

41:38.960 --> 41:40.790
I'm almost 30 years old.

41:41.710 --> 41:43.550
After all these years in Beijing,

41:43.760 --> 41:45.230
among my college roommates,

41:45.230 --> 41:46.980
even the least successful one lives in Swan Bay

41:47.030 --> 41:48.190
and drives an X5.

41:49.670 --> 41:50.440
But me?

41:50.840 --> 41:53.030
I have to be alert every time I take a cab.

41:53.360 --> 41:55.110
When there's traffic and the driver takes a detour,

41:55.110 --> 41:56.280
I start to panic.

41:58.880 --> 42:00.670
I'm a graduate from a top university.

42:01.160 --> 42:02.800
I've won first-class scholarships.

42:02.840 --> 42:04.820
Is this any way for me to live?

42:10.040 --> 42:10.600
Being poor

42:11.930 --> 42:13.010
is still the original sin, huh?

42:13.030 --> 42:14.220
Haikuo.

42:15.410 --> 42:17.430
I know you've been trying hard,

42:17.790 --> 42:19.270
but I'm sorry.

42:20.220 --> 42:21.900
I no longer have the time

42:22.320 --> 42:24.920
or patience to chase after your empty promises.

42:26.800 --> 42:28.070
Do you get what I'm saying?

42:28.510 --> 42:29.260
Yes.

42:46.940 --> 42:48.320
You again?

42:51.880 --> 42:52.630
Officer Xia.

42:52.790 --> 42:54.540
Didn't you get a proper job?

42:55.000 --> 42:56.440
Why are you causing trouble again?

42:56.880 --> 42:58.000
He deserved a beating.

42:59.480 --> 43:00.800
If you were me, you'd have hit him too.

43:01.560 --> 43:03.080
Don't tell me all that.

43:03.100 --> 43:04.310
Tell that to your superior.

43:07.920 --> 43:08.710
My superior?
